/target

# Runtime state of a workspace. `**/` because an example may carry its own
# `.uni/` beside its registry (examples/identity-github-actions), and a
# root-anchored pattern would leave that state tracked.
**/.uni/evidence/
**/.uni/decisions/
**/.uni/artifacts/
# `uni import-speckit` writes a candidate contract and its work order together.
# Both are generated output for review, never a source: nothing in the tree
# should ship one.
**/.uni/contracts/candidate-*
**/.uni/events.jsonl
**/.uni/.registry.hash
**/.uni/.registry.snapshot.toml
**/.uni/.lock

experiments/study-50/tasks/**/Cargo.lock
experiments/study-50/tasks/**/target/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
